<Item XName="Read Me" UserName="Read Me" Type="Notes">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;DIV align=center&gt;&lt;FONT size=4 face=Arial&gt;&lt;SPAN class=440084521-05112003&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;System&amp;nbsp;Simulation&amp;nbsp;Template&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;SPAN class=440084521-05112003&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV align=center&gt;&lt;FONT color=#0000ff face=Arial&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;HR&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN class=440084521-05112003&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Create a&amp;nbsp;system simulation by defining the system in a schematic (Sch1),&amp;nbsp;adding a system analysis&amp;nbsp;(System1), and entering the measurement to be displayed on the graph (Spec Out or Cascaded Gain).&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;OL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN class=440084521-05112003&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Enter the&amp;nbsp;system&amp;nbsp;block diagram&amp;nbsp;in the schematic. For a two port device, the elements are positioned between the source and output&amp;nbsp;port.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN class=440084521-05112003&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Change the source frequency and power by double clicking the source and clicking the edit button. Change other system parameters&amp;nbsp;in the system analysis dialog box (System1) if desired.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN class=440084521-05112003&gt;&lt;FONT size=2 face=Arial&gt;Double click on the graph to display the Graph Properties Box. Enter the measurements to be displayed on the graph, one measurement per line. Adjust the scaling as desired.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/OL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN class=440084521-05112003&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp; For more information see the Examples.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;</Text>
